'''Blue Vampire's Edge''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to players who finished as one of the Top 100 recipients on the [[Halloween Event 2020]] Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Blue Vampire's Edge has the same appearance as [[Vampire's Edge]], but replacing the red ridges with cobalt blue ridges.

== Trivia ==
* During the event, players could collect [[Candies (2020)|Candies]] (act exactly like [[coins]] but Halloween-exclusive), which determined their rank on the leaderboard.
*When this item first came out on December 13th, 2020, it displayed as a [[Godly Weapons|godly]], and was fixed roughly an hour later.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Vampire's Edge]], [[Silver Vampire's Edge]], and [[Gold Vampire's Edge]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The revamped version of this item was uploaded on January 23rd, 2023.

